From 6d1ae6a014131865420c3c8bdb0181fc14444f27 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: leow149 <leow149@lucidmail.xyz>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 00:21:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 12/34] drm/panel: Add Orise OTM1289A / ER68576 MIPI DSI panel
 driver

720x1280 video-mode DSI panel used in the TrimUI Smart Pro. Units ship with
either an OTM1289A or an ER68576 controller behind the same module; the driver
reads the panel ID and sends the matching init sequence, falling back to the
OTM1289A one like the stock firmware.

Signed-off-by: leow149 <leow149@lucidmail.xyz>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Kconfig                 |   8 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Makefile                |   1 +
 .../gpu/drm/panel/panel-orisetech-otm1289a.c  | 453 ++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 462 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-orisetech-otm1289a.c

